usage: rebis.serpentrod foldv2 [-h] [--name NAME] [--pdb PDB]
                               [--pdb-chain PDB_CHAIN]
                               [rna]

Execute the full re-imscribed amino-acid words through Vox. JSON retains co-
held chemical forms, torsion articulations and observations without
probability weights. PDB exports the codon-aligned coordinate readout with
source identifiers.

positional arguments:
  rna                   RNA sequence

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --name NAME           Protein name
  --pdb PDB             Output PDB structure file path
  --pdb-chain PDB_CHAIN
                        Chain ID for PDB (default: A)
